# vr-wakerhd
===
 VR-WakerHD: open-source VR port and mod of The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker HD. First person with head tracking, motion controls, physical sword. OpenXR PC VR (Windows/Linux) and standalone Quest 3/3S. Built on ZeldaWWHDRecomp; bring your own copy..
